Wish for: a blessed +3 broadsword named Stormbringer (and be very very
careful about the spelling!).

However, it's often easier for a chaotic character to get Stormy by
sacrificing at a chaotic altar.

: And what of all the talk about
: other artifacts, Hand of Elbereth and That Mj.??? thing?  I've played this
: game for months and I've never found any of that stuff?  You probably
: have to go through one of those long procedures to get any of this stuff.

The Hand of Elbereth is an "appointment" given a lawful character by the
gods.  The result is Excalibur (if you're wielding a longsword when this
happens) and a slew of intrinsics...as well as some other side effects.

Mjollnir is the hammer of Thor, Norse god of thunder.  In Nethack, it's a
very damaging weapon (does like +20 or something electricity damage!).

You can wish for any of these weapons, or be granted them by sacrificing
(if you are of the proper alignment and very lucky).

